Yes, thanks for being such a good friend of my brother.

00:26:44.050 --> 00:26:46.050
I'm his younger sister, Sakura.

00:26:46.050 --> 00:26:47.030
His younger sister?

00:26:47.030 --> 00:26:48.870
Aren't you the oldest?

00:26:48.870 --> 00:26:51.780
No, I'm the youngest.

00:26:51.780 --> 00:26:54.630
It's not possible. How could you...

00:26:54.630 --> 00:26:57.630
Because it's been 14 years since you opened your stupid eyes.

00:26:57.630 --> 00:26:59.340
Idiot Shinji.

00:26:59.340 --> 00:26:59.760
Huh?

00:27:00.280 --> 00:27:01.710
Asuka!

00:27:01.710 --> 00:27:15.450
I can't do it.

00:27:15.450 --> 00:27:16.770
He won't stay back.

00:27:16.770 --> 00:27:18.550
I can't stop him anymore.

00:27:18.550 --> 00:27:25.960
What can't you stop?

00:27:25.960 --> 00:27:28.990
Too much anger and repressed sadness.

00:27:30.030 --> 00:27:32.400
I don't understand what...

00:27:32.400 --> 00:27:34.400
Wait! Asuka! Your left eye!

00:27:34.400 --> 00:27:36.370
It's nothing of your concern.

00:27:36.370 --> 00:27:43.050
Asuka, if 14 years have passed, why haven't you changed anything? Just the eye?

00:27:43.050 --> 00:27:46.340
The curse. The curse of the Seba.

00:27:46.340 --> 00:27:56.170
What does that mean?

00:27:56.170 --> 00:27:57.190
I have no idea.

00:27:57.190 --> 00:28:00.000
What do you mean you have no idea? I saved her!

00:28:00.670 --> 00:28:07.040
It doesn't even matter if you saved her, we don't have time to worry about a poor person, not in this world

00:28:07.040 --> 00:28:09.960
Isn't that right, Colonel Katsuragi?

00:28:09.960 --> 00:28:17.480
Misato, please tell me!

00:28:17.480 --> 00:28:21.760
You must know, Rei Ayanami no longer exists in this world

00:28:21.760 --> 00:28:27.240
It can't be, I'm sure I saved her, maybe she's still in Unit 1

00:28:27.240 --> 00:28:28.840
Check if she's in there!

00:28:28.840 --> 00:28:29.640
Shinji

00:28:30.000 --> 00:28:35.920
We checked every centimeter of unit 1, the only thing that was left inside were you and this

00:28:35.920 --> 00:28:43.180
We don't know why, but it was rebuilt, the tests we did were clean, so you can have it

00:28:43.180 --> 00:28:50.740
This was my father's, and Rey took it on board, which means I have to save her

00:28:50.740 --> 00:28:54.810
What's going on?

00:28:54.810 --> 00:28:56.200
Talk to me

00:28:56.200 --> 00:29:00.000
Get the observation staff, wait for a second wave of chaos

00:29:00.000 --> 00:29:01.200
to make the final blow.

00:29:01.220 --> 00:29:06.760
Let's start the game!

00:29:06.760 --> 00:29:09.760
Of course, Alteza.

00:29:09.800 --> 00:29:13.060
But first things first, how is our little puppy?

00:29:13.100 --> 00:29:15.400
He was sitting like a good boy.

00:29:15.440 --> 00:29:17.440
It's the same stupid face

00:29:17.480 --> 00:29:19.000
that was on the bedside table.

00:29:19.040 --> 00:29:22.240
That silly face you have is what you wanted to see, right?

00:29:22.280 --> 00:29:26.220
Shut up! I went there to hit him, and I feel better!

00:29:26.240 --> 00:29:30.000
My god! Tell me what's going on!

00:29:32.010 --> 00:29:34.730
Shinji Ikari, where are you?

00:29:34.730 --> 00:29:37.730
That was Rei, did you hear that?

00:29:37.730 --> 00:29:40.080
It's Misa!

00:29:40.080 --> 00:29:48.750
Ready, Mr. Ikari, you have to come with me!

00:29:48.750 --> 00:29:51.420
Tell me, Shinji, where are you?

00:29:51.420 --> 00:29:52.770
It's Rei!

00:29:54.590 --> 00:29:56.210
Rei is looking for me!

00:29:56.210 --> 00:29:58.160
Ikari!

00:30:01.660 --> 00:30:04.440
It's enough

00:30:04.440 --> 00:30:20.890
You know what?

00:30:20.890 --> 00:30:25.440
Shinji, come with me

00:30:25.440 --> 00:30:29.120
You're with us

00:30:30.350 --> 00:30:33.590
I can do it. You made it very clear to me that they don't need me.

00:30:33.590 --> 00:30:36.230
Regardless of that, you are under custody.

00:30:36.230 --> 00:30:38.450
Why? Because you say so?

00:30:38.450 --> 00:30:45.390
That's enough!

00:30:45.390 --> 00:30:50.430
The last Eva of NERF!

00:30:50.430 --> 00:30:53.630
Evas of NERF? But isn't that a part of NERF?

00:30:53.630 --> 00:30:57.780
No, we are Vile. Our goal is to annihilate NERF.

00:30:57.780 --> 00:30:59.290
But that is...

00:30:59.290 --> 00:31:00.000
No!

00:31:02.400 --> 00:31:03.200
Is Rey there?

00:31:03.240 --> 00:31:06.120
She's not there. I told you, she doesn't exist anymore.

00:31:06.160 --> 00:31:09.250
You're lying! She's in Unit 1!

00:31:09.290 --> 00:31:11.910
How can you be so blind? Forget about it!

00:31:17.190 --> 00:31:24.550
You better never go up to anything but this!

00:31:35.820 --> 00:31:36.320
Boss

00:31:40.850 --> 00:31:43.920
Look at me in white, I never fail

00:31:43.920 --> 00:31:47.670
Very good, walking

00:31:47.670 --> 00:31:54.390
It looked like that!

00:32:00.730 --> 00:32:10.100
The ship of the Adanes?

00:32:10.100 --> 00:32:12.980
Tino!

00:32:12.980 --> 00:32:15.910
They don't care about Unit 1, only him!

00:32:15.910 --> 00:32:19.540
Because they know they can still use him as a detonator. Misato!

00:32:19.540 --> 00:32:22.680
Use the gargantua now!

00:32:22.680 --> 00:32:25.570
Out of range.

00:32:35.690 --> 00:32:38.730
Speak to EXO's directives. There is no need to continue.

00:32:38.730 --> 00:32:42.810
To all personnel, reschedule emergency repairs and finish equipping the ship.

00:32:45.050 --> 00:32:46.480
I changed my mind.

00:32:46.480 --> 00:32:49.400
He's not an idiot, he's a moron.

00:32:49.400 --> 00:32:51.600
Evangelion, 9th edition, Q.

00:33:06.430 --> 00:33:08.390
I knew I saved her, I knew it!

00:33:08.390 --> 00:33:10.940
You lied to me, Misato!

00:33:10.940 --> 00:33:13.300
Follow me.

00:33:13.800 --> 00:33:21.880
So...

00:33:21.880 --> 00:33:22.900
Uh...

00:33:38.920 --> 00:33:40.600
Isn't this the Geofront?

00:33:40.600 --> 00:33:49.840
Why can we see the sky?

00:33:49.840 --> 00:33:54.340
Is that the headquarters?

00:33:54.340 --> 00:33:57.010
What happened here?

00:34:27.640 --> 00:34:30.000
He didn't lie when he said that 14 years had passed

00:34:30.000 --> 00:34:30.930
Fourteen years?

00:35:06.910 --> 00:35:07.650
We're here.

00:35:07.650 --> 00:35:11.250
What is that?

00:35:11.250 --> 00:35:14.380
An Eva?

00:35:14.380 --> 00:35:15.490
It's correct.

00:35:16.490 --> 00:35:20.580
Father!

00:35:20.580 --> 00:35:22.820
This is Evangelion Unit 13.

00:35:22.820 --> 00:35:26.160
You will share this unit with your co-pilot.

00:35:26.160 --> 00:35:30.000
Weren't you the one who played the piano?

00:35:31.850 --> 00:35:35.050
When the time comes, both of you will pilot this EVA.

00:35:35.050 --> 00:35:37.400
The talk is over.

00:35:38.840 --> 00:35:39.380
Wait!

00:35:39.380 --> 00:35:57.330
There are no numbers to mark.

00:35:57.330 --> 00:35:59.980
I think they just want me to get calls.

00:36:20.860 --> 00:36:23.680
Oh yeah! I have to go thank him!

00:37:17.020 --> 00:37:19.020
I wonder what place this will be.

00:37:19.020 --> 00:37:21.600
Is that Rey?

00:37:21.600 --> 00:37:23.880
I didn't think I was going to find her!

00:37:35.820 --> 00:37:37.990
Is that an order?

00:37:37.990 --> 00:37:40.850
I'm going to pass

00:37:40.850 --> 00:37:49.260
I just wanted to thank you for this

00:37:49.260 --> 00:37:51.730
Thank you for keeping him safe

00:38:01.180 --> 00:38:03.450
I think you have a new suit

00:38:03.450 --> 00:38:05.450
Black is an interesting choice

00:38:05.450 --> 00:38:13.670
It's so strange

00:38:13.670 --> 00:38:16.580
Everything has changed a lot since yesterday

00:38:16.580 --> 00:38:21.200
None of this makes sense

00:38:21.200 --> 00:38:25.140
Why now Misato and the others are fighting against Nerf?

00:38:25.140 --> 00:38:27.510
And what is my father doing?

00:38:27.510 --> 00:38:30.000
And what happened to the others?

00:38:30.960 --> 00:38:31.890
What has happened?

00:38:31.890 --> 00:38:34.390
I don't know.

00:38:34.390 --> 00:38:35.380
I see.

00:38:35.380 --> 00:38:40.400
I think you don't know.

00:38:40.400 --> 00:38:43.280
So, tell me how you managed to get out of Unit 1.

00:38:43.280 --> 00:38:53.460
This place is not even an adequate room.

00:38:53.460 --> 00:38:59.520
I know you've always been minimalist, but even so, it seems like there's nothing left.

00:39:00.320 --> 00:39:01.770
So what are you doing?

00:39:01.770 --> 00:39:05.540
I'm waiting for the orders.

00:39:05.540 --> 00:39:10.330
You don't even have books! Don't you get bored?

00:39:10.330 --> 00:39:15.830
Books? So Rei Ayanami reads books?

00:39:15.830 --> 00:39:20.410
Yes. You used to read all the time. You loved reading.

00:39:20.410 --> 00:39:21.480
I see.

00:39:21.480 --> 00:39:25.710
I'll tell you something. I'll go look for some books in the library and bring them to you.

00:39:25.710 --> 00:39:30.000
Um... Are books in Spanish okay? You like those, right? You used to always...

00:39:30.030 --> 00:39:31.980
- You had one in your hand. - I liked them?

00:39:31.980 --> 00:39:37.780
- Yes! At least that's what I thought. - What do you mean, "that"?

00:39:37.780 --> 00:39:51.570
There's no news from Selly. From what I see, they're still keeping silence.

00:39:51.570 --> 00:39:56.310
The Human Instrumentalization Project will be held according to the Dead Sea Scrolls.

00:39:56.310 --> 00:39:59.310
At this point, there is no need for them to speak.

00:40:00.090 --> 00:40:04.400
Ikari, are you planning to occupy Unit 13 for the next mission?

00:40:04.400 --> 00:40:11.270
Well, it doesn't matter. I'll join whatever you've planned.

00:40:11.270 --> 00:40:13.570
For the good of Yui, at least.

00:40:17.320 --> 00:40:20.380
I think it's messed up.

00:40:26.790 --> 00:40:29.540
You won't do anything. It's not something of your power.

00:40:31.050 --> 00:40:33.200
-Pilotea Eleva. -I don't know.

00:41:00.350 --> 00:41:17.520
Ayanami

00:41:17.520 --> 00:41:29.910
You're down here, Shinji.

00:41:30.280 --> 00:41:31.280
We're going to talk.

00:41:31.280 --> 00:41:38.030
I thought you wanted to talk.

00:41:38.030 --> 00:41:40.020
This is not exactly what I thought.

00:41:40.020 --> 00:41:42.760
Playing the piano with four hands is a conversation.

00:41:42.760 --> 00:41:44.790
Only on the scales.

00:41:44.790 --> 00:41:49.960
But how can I do it?

00:41:49.960 --> 00:41:51.760
If you want to live life,

00:41:51.760 --> 00:41:54.710
you can't be afraid of the change that brings to do new things.

00:41:54.710 --> 00:42:00.000
It's easy.

00:42:00.960 --> 00:42:04.740
Just put your hands and use them to touch the keys from here.

00:42:04.740 --> 00:42:22.110
Participate.

00:42:22.110 --> 00:42:24.200
Okay.

00:42:44.940 --> 00:42:48.080
It's amazing. I like playing music with you.

00:43:23.390 --> 00:43:29.000
The sounds are very funny, isn't it nice what two people can do?

00:43:33.680 --> 00:43:37.690
Thank you. It's the first time I've had fun in years.

00:43:37.690 --> 00:43:40.560
Yeah, me too. Let's do it again.

00:43:40.560 --> 00:43:43.390
As many times as you want. Sounds good, Shinji?

00:43:43.390 --> 00:43:44.310
Uh-huh.

00:43:44.310 --> 00:43:45.360
Uh...

00:43:45.360 --> 00:43:46.140
Um...

00:43:46.140 --> 00:43:47.110
Who are you?

00:43:47.110 --> 00:43:50.300
I'm Kaoru. Kaoru Naiza.

00:43:50.300 --> 00:43:53.590
I'm a boy with a fatal destiny, just like you.

00:44:00.120 --> 00:44:02.030
Rei hasn't arrived yet.

00:44:02.030 --> 00:44:04.200
And he didn't even touch the books.

00:44:04.200 --> 00:44:25.830
What's up, Shinji? You came very early.

00:44:25.830 --> 00:44:28.800
Actually, I have nothing else to do.

00:44:58.640 --> 00:45:00.000
Is there any technique I can learn?

00:45:00.000 --> 00:45:05.160
Don't worry about how you play, just make sounds that make you feel good.

00:45:05.160 --> 00:45:11.790
Well, what will make me feel good if I play better?

00:45:11.790 --> 00:45:19.450
Then keep practicing, repeat the same thing over and over again, until you are satisfied with what makes you feel.

00:45:19.450 --> 00:45:22.920
It's all you can do.

00:45:53.360 --> 00:45:56.360
No problem. I know I can make it work again.

00:45:56.360 --> 00:46:00.000
Really? Thank you. I feel bad for asking you later.

00:46:00.000 --> 00:46:01.540
after everything you've done.

00:46:01.540 --> 00:46:02.950
Don't feel bad.

00:46:02.950 --> 00:46:05.440
Anyway, we're friends.

00:46:05.440 --> 00:46:11.610
It's starting to get dark.

00:46:11.610 --> 00:46:13.860
I think we should say goodbye.

00:46:13.860 --> 00:46:17.030
Wait, let's stay a little longer.

00:46:17.030 --> 00:46:19.270
We can stay to see the stars.

00:46:19.270 --> 00:46:20.520
The stars?

00:46:20.520 --> 00:46:24.830
Do you like to see the stars?

00:46:24.830 --> 00:46:26.490
Yes.

00:46:26.490 --> 00:46:29.280
Contemplate the immensity of the universe.

00:46:30.000 --> 00:46:32.890
It gives me a feeling of serenity

00:46:32.890 --> 00:46:36.090
Since I was a child

00:46:36.090 --> 00:46:37.720
I'm 14 years old

00:46:37.720 --> 00:46:39.950
Nothing outside has changed

00:46:39.950 --> 00:46:42.000
Which is comforting

00:46:42.000 --> 00:46:45.060
It makes me feel that the things that happen to me actually do not matter

00:46:45.060 --> 00:46:47.100
And that there is something that brings peace in that

00:46:48.440 --> 00:46:50.210
What I say makes sense?

00:46:50.210 --> 00:46:52.910
That feeling is understood very well

00:46:52.910 --> 00:46:54.460
Avoiding change

00:46:54.460 --> 00:46:58.070
You prefer the indifferent and empty world of the abyss

00:46:58.070 --> 00:46:59.350
That's just like you

00:47:00.350 --> 00:47:06.970
This is nice, the two of us lying here talking. Who would have thought that something so simple could feel so good?

00:47:06.970 --> 00:47:10.380
Thanks for inviting me to spend a few moments with you.

00:47:10.380 --> 00:47:16.930
No, it's nothing, I just thought that, well, it could be fun to see the stars.

00:47:18.280 --> 00:47:24.160
It's fun. Now I realize that I was born to meet you.

00:47:35.500 --> 00:47:36.000
Hm?

00:47:38.030 --> 00:47:42.850
It's different. It's too big for me.

00:47:46.560 --> 00:47:48.270
Toyi Sosuhara.

00:47:50.460 --> 00:47:53.660
It should work fine now.

00:47:54.460 --> 00:47:55.220
Thank you!

00:47:55.900 --> 00:47:57.780
You're amazing, Kaoru!

00:47:58.240 --> 00:47:59.570
You can do whatever you want!

00:48:00.000 --> 00:48:06.140
They are only applied knowledge. I have spent more time than you in this world to capture these things.

00:48:06.140 --> 00:48:08.770
Well, you're amazing.

00:48:08.770 --> 00:48:16.510
You seem a little changed. Is something wrong?

00:48:16.510 --> 00:48:20.670
I can't stop thinking about my friends.

00:48:20.670 --> 00:48:22.490
Your old friends?

00:48:22.490 --> 00:48:30.000
Yes. There used to be a city above the NERV headquarters. Everyone lived there. Touji,

00:48:30.000 --> 00:48:37.170
It's just that, my classmates, apparently I was catatonic inside unit 1 for 14 years

00:48:37.170 --> 00:48:41.540
And everything changed, changed a lot while I was there

00:48:41.540 --> 00:48:45.520
And those changes are very strong for you, you are suffering

00:48:45.520 --> 00:48:53.170
I'm a little worried about what has happened to the city and its inhabitants

00:48:53.170 --> 00:48:58.610
Not knowing anything, just asking, kills me with fear

00:49:06.720 --> 00:49:07.940
Do you want to know?

00:49:31.760 --> 00:49:56.080
We're almost there.

00:50:13.660 --> 00:50:19.200
There will soon be a gap in the clouds and you will have all the answers you are looking for.

00:50:34.350 --> 00:50:39.890
It is the result of your assimilation with Unit-01, the result of the third impact.

00:50:39.890 --> 00:50:46.200
Are you referring to all those I knew?

00:50:46.200 --> 00:50:53.460
The massive extinctions are not alien to this planet, they actually help to stimulate evolution.

00:50:53.460 --> 00:50:59.700
After all, most of the life forms are transformed to adapt to the world, the Lilith

00:51:00.000 --> 00:51:04.760
unique in that sense. They work to transform the world instead of themselves.

00:51:04.760 --> 00:51:09.840
They instituted a ritual that accelerates the process and the evolution

00:51:09.840 --> 00:51:15.610
artificially. A ritual that sacrifices an ancient way of life to

00:51:15.610 --> 00:51:20.830
bring the fruit of life to a new life and give way to its reign. It is an

00:51:20.830 --> 00:51:25.470
programmed, devised and realized extinction from ancient times.

00:51:25.470 --> 00:51:29.190
NERV named this ritual as the project of human instrumentalization.

00:51:30.000 --> 00:51:34.990
So NERV did this?

00:51:34.990 --> 00:51:39.970
My father, what are you doing?

00:51:39.970 --> 00:51:46.670
Listen Shinji, once he woke up, Unit 01 Eva opened Goff's doors

00:51:46.670 --> 00:51:53.530
and became a catalyst for the third impact, what Lilith calls the third near impact.

00:51:53.530 --> 00:51:57.720
Someone brought all this, it was you.

00:52:00.890 --> 00:52:06.560
No... It wasn't my intention... I just... I just wanted to save Rey...

00:52:08.100 --> 00:52:11.260
It could be... But you were still the detonator.

00:52:12.270 --> 00:52:14.720
This can't be...

00:52:22.640 --> 00:52:28.640
It's true... You can't do anything to change the past... But this is the truth I wanted to know...

00:52:30.380 --> 00:52:38.890
As a consequence, the Lilith has forced you to carry the loads of that sin, isn't it what represents what you carry on your neck?

00:52:38.890 --> 00:52:45.810
My sin? It does nothing!

00:52:45.810 --> 00:52:54.380
I'm afraid the others don't see it that way. However, all sins can be purged.

00:52:54.380 --> 00:53:00.000
There is still hope, Shinji. There will always be hope.

00:53:00.000 --> 00:53:03.160
Gellion 3.33. You can't redo it.

00:53:03.160 --> 00:53:18.820
The young Selly seems to have made contact with the third young man.

00:53:18.820 --> 00:53:21.840
He even revealed the outside world to them.

00:53:21.840 --> 00:53:24.420
I can't imagine how he must be taking it.

00:53:24.420 --> 00:53:27.060
Do you agree with this, Ikari?

00:53:27.060 --> 00:53:30.000
We will be in charge of rewriting the Selly script.

00:53:30.000 --> 00:53:34.180
All his existence is just a tool for revision.

00:53:34.180 --> 00:53:38.890
And you think that opening up with your son, talking to him about the work of your life will not work?

00:53:38.890 --> 00:53:42.420
Honestly, I can't say I believe it.

00:53:42.420 --> 00:53:49.680
Why did this happen? It is supposed that things would not end like this.

00:53:49.680 --> 00:54:00.000
Why? Save Rey, is not it? Is not that right?

00:54:00.060 --> 00:54:01.260
Wasn't that enough?

00:54:01.260 --> 00:54:25.920
Our king is not here again

00:54:25.920 --> 00:54:28.420
And he hasn't read them yet

00:54:30.440 --> 00:54:31.440
What's going on?

00:54:31.440 --> 00:54:32.770
Rey too?

00:54:32.770 --> 00:54:34.950
How can he treat me like this?

00:54:34.950 --> 00:54:47.180
Tell me, third young man, do you know how to play shogi?

00:54:47.180 --> 00:54:51.050
Yes, of course, I know the rules.

00:54:51.050 --> 00:54:52.050
That's enough.

00:54:52.050 --> 00:54:54.050
So let's play.

00:54:54.050 --> 00:54:56.790
I'll even give you the tower and the pin.

00:55:04.800 --> 00:55:07.500
You have to calm your mind and calm down.

00:55:07.500 --> 00:55:11.080
It's a necessary task to win the battles.

00:55:11.080 --> 00:55:13.680
You only have 31 moves.

00:55:13.680 --> 00:55:20.410
Let me kill you first.

00:55:20.410 --> 00:55:26.090
This is very pleasant.

00:55:26.090 --> 00:55:30.000
Thank you for taking the time to please

00:55:30.000 --> 00:55:38.760
old man with his pastime. I also easily intimidate myself. Without a pretext like this, I doubt

00:55:38.760 --> 00:55:45.080
that I could have talked to you in this way. Tell me, do you remember anything about your mother?

00:55:45.080 --> 00:55:54.360
No, I was very small when she ... and then ... my father got rid of all his belongings.

00:55:54.360 --> 00:56:00.000
Hmm? It looks like ...

00:56:00.000 --> 00:56:14.700
That woman is your mother. Her name is Yui Ayanami. She was my student at the university and now she works controlling the system in unit 1 Eva.

00:56:14.700 --> 00:56:30.000
It looks like they finally repaired the electricity. This is the prototype of Eva's control system. Yui created the injection method.

00:56:30.000 --> 00:56:37.670
direct entry to the core and provoked it with herself in this system you

00:56:37.670 --> 00:56:47.670
also saw it although your memories of then were erased from

00:56:47.670 --> 00:56:52.630
the beginning she disappeared with the system the only thing left of her are

00:56:52.630 --> 00:56:57.300
the data of the series and to me the king and to me that you got to know

00:56:57.300 --> 00:56:59.760
it was just a replica of your mother

00:57:00.060 --> 00:57:05.760
And just like your mother before her, that girl is stored in the system of unit 1.

00:57:05.760 --> 00:57:08.160
Everything is part of your father's plan.

00:57:08.160 --> 00:57:12.130
This can't be true.

00:57:12.130 --> 00:57:15.820
It's shocking to see how simple it is to undo the world.

00:57:15.820 --> 00:57:19.830
But rebuilding it from the beginning is not so easy.

00:57:19.830 --> 00:57:26.740
Like at the same time, the course of the world cannot be reversed, nor the heart of the people.

00:57:26.740 --> 00:57:30.000
That is why, in order to make this wish come true,

00:57:30.000 --> 00:57:36.350
Hikari is making great sacrifices that include her own spirit.

00:57:36.350 --> 00:57:53.390
I thought it was good that you knew something about the truth and that you knew about your father,

00:57:53.390 --> 00:57:56.910
such a painful and unpleasant role.

00:57:56.910 --> 00:58:00.000
Chuy, I hope this was

00:58:00.000 --> 00:58:07.770
That's not what you wanted.

00:58:07.770 --> 00:58:11.870
The time of the final agreement is approaching.

00:58:11.870 --> 00:58:23.640
We'll see each other soon, Yui.

00:58:23.640 --> 00:58:27.560
Why haven't you read any of the books I left you?

00:58:27.560 --> 00:58:30.000
They didn't order me to do it.

00:58:40.520 --> 00:58:48.020
Yes, Rei Ayanami. I know.

00:59:03.640 --> 00:59:09.250
So I really didn't save her... I lost Rey...

00:59:09.250 --> 00:59:13.770
You won't do anything, I won't get rid of your incumbency...

00:59:13.770 --> 00:59:14.870
Father!

00:59:14.870 --> 00:59:21.640
Come on! I won't get rid of your incumbency... I won't get rid of your incumbency...

00:59:21.640 --> 00:59:22.820
Mom?

00:59:22.820 --> 00:59:27.010
You won't do anything, I won't get rid of your incumbency...

00:59:35.560 --> 00:59:51.990
I don't know about your stupidity.

01:00:00.380 --> 01:00:02.620
What have I been doing with my life?

01:00:38.640 --> 01:00:42.260
So, the final execution is finished.

01:00:42.260 --> 01:00:45.810
Yes. Now we have all the tools we need.

01:00:49.300 --> 01:00:54.000
The time has come. It's the moment, Shinji Ikari.

01:01:00.670 --> 01:01:15.100
and review the same traumatic event in the mind over and over again, what could be good about that?

01:01:15.100 --> 01:01:29.030
The changes that were administered with the EVA can be reversed once you are in it.

01:01:36.650 --> 01:01:56.750
Yes, you can trust me.

01:02:00.730 --> 01:02:02.300
I understand.

01:02:02.300 --> 01:02:05.530
The curse of Lilith and the risk of waking up Eva.

01:02:05.530 --> 01:02:15.310
I will carry that weight for you.

01:02:15.310 --> 01:02:18.160
Don't let that bother you.

01:02:18.160 --> 01:02:22.230
Lilith made this gargantua because she was afraid of me.

01:02:22.230 --> 01:02:27.210
Anyway, I've been planning to do it.

01:02:27.210 --> 01:02:28.980
Listen to me, Shinji.

01:02:28.980 --> 01:02:30.000
Your only hope

01:02:30.000 --> 01:02:37.210
The key is to recover the two spears of the heart of Central Dogma, they are the key to start the project of human instrumentation.

01:02:37.210 --> 01:02:43.730
The two of us can crush them, without them, NERV will not be able to unleash the fourth impact,

01:02:43.730 --> 01:02:49.920
but in our hands, together with unit 13, they will grant us the power to restore the world.

01:02:49.920 --> 01:02:57.400
It's true, yes, I know you can do it.

01:02:57.400 --> 01:02:59.570
I will not do it alone, with you.

01:03:00.060 --> 01:03:03.320
Unit 13 is equipped with a double-play system.

01:03:03.320 --> 01:03:09.200
Together, we can restore Lilith's hope, and it's what you need the most for now.

01:03:09.200 --> 01:03:12.540
About anything else, you need hope.

01:03:12.540 --> 01:03:15.370
Expiation and mental peace will help you get it.

01:03:15.370 --> 01:03:18.770
You're amazing.

01:03:18.770 --> 01:03:21.970
You know what I'm going through.

01:03:21.970 --> 01:03:24.990
It's because all I do is think of you.

01:03:26.400 --> 01:03:30.000
Kaoru, thank you.

01:03:30.640 --> 01:03:32.630
Not at all. We're friends.

01:03:32.630 --> 01:03:38.080
Yes. You're really a great friend.

01:03:38.080 --> 01:03:46.830
It'll be like playing the piano, good things happen when we're together, right Shinji?

01:03:46.830 --> 01:03:51.280
It's true. Let's go, Kaoru.

01:04:30.800 --> 01:04:33.720
Evangelion unit 13, now!

01:04:35.720 --> 01:04:38.640
It's the signal! A new Eva has been activated!

01:04:38.640 --> 01:05:00.000
And that we would only be

01:05:00.000 --> 01:05:06.390
Are you talking about Mark IX? He came to support us, just in case Vi intervenes.

01:05:06.390 --> 01:05:12.960
Why? We can handle him, he's not even the true king.

01:05:12.960 --> 01:05:15.010
I'm not a king, sorry.

01:05:15.010 --> 01:05:21.210
The walls!

01:05:21.210 --> 01:05:25.890
Yes, they are the remains of those who were at the height of infinity.

01:05:30.320 --> 01:05:37.350
It's not something to worry about. We're almost at the Lilith seal.

01:05:37.350 --> 01:05:43.500
The main axis is completely blocked. Not even once in 14 years has it allowed someone to pass.

01:05:43.500 --> 01:05:51.570
Oh, it looks like a big cover.

01:05:51.570 --> 01:05:59.090
Everything will be fine. Unit 13 was designed specifically to overcome it. I know that we will achieve it together.

01:06:08.090 --> 01:06:11.900
We have to sync, like when we play the piano together

01:06:15.550 --> 01:06:17.460
Very well Shinji, here we go

01:06:18.600 --> 01:06:20.640
Approaching the final containment chair

01:06:59.150 --> 01:06:59.730
We did it!

01:07:00.480 --> 01:07:08.390
The lowest level of Central Dogma, the epicenter of the Third Impact.

01:07:08.390 --> 01:07:15.840
That's... Lilith?

01:07:15.840 --> 01:07:19.840
What's left of her, you're seeing her remains.

01:07:19.840 --> 01:07:27.760
Poor Misato, she risked her life to protect her, that's an Eva?

01:07:27.760 --> 01:07:30.000
That's right, that's what's left of the Eva.

01:07:30.000 --> 01:07:35.110
Mark VI. Lilith modified it so that it was autonomous and those are the debris of his

01:07:35.110 --> 01:07:36.110
attempt.

01:07:36.110 --> 01:07:44.980
Those things came out of Lilith? Is that what we came for?

01:07:44.980 --> 01:07:51.260
That's right, Longinus and Cassius. Removing them requires two souls, it is the only way

01:07:51.260 --> 01:07:55.760
that they can be removed. That is why the double game system is needed.

01:07:55.760 --> 01:07:59.670
Well, if that's all, couldn't he have taken my place easily?

01:08:00.600 --> 01:08:06.310
Not at all. A replica can not take the place of Lilith, her soul resides in a different place from ours.

01:08:06.310 --> 01:08:08.620
Now, let's start.

01:08:08.620 --> 01:08:18.910
Wait a second. Something went out.

01:08:18.910 --> 01:08:21.860
What's going on, Kaoru?

01:08:21.860 --> 01:08:29.060
This is not good. It seems that they changed shape. Now they are matching.

01:08:29.060 --> 01:08:30.000
Hurry up and let's get out of here!

01:08:31.500 --> 01:08:32.500
Isn't that true?

01:08:36.480 --> 01:08:37.530
What the hell is going on?

01:08:38.520 --> 01:08:53.230
You two!

01:08:54.230 --> 01:08:55.230
Stop here!

01:08:55.230 --> 01:08:58.430
You're an idiot!

01:09:07.260 --> 01:09:28.200
You know about the Adanes, I know I can't throw you out of my head, but at least I can have you on the floor

01:10:09.850 --> 01:10:11.300
You are very naïve.

01:10:11.300 --> 01:10:30.000
Chino, it is imperative

01:10:30.090 --> 01:10:42.070
Let's get both spears, but these two look identical, as if they were one and the same, so that's it, now I understand, Lilith!

01:10:42.070 --> 01:10:59.670
Selly Provisional pilot, you hear me right? I would not think of leaving that Eva, before I go to the ship of the Adanes, I can't, those are not my orders.

01:11:00.600 --> 01:11:05.710
You're very tense. I missed your original version, it was much more friendly.

01:11:05.710 --> 01:11:11.080
Original? A different me?

01:12:01.120 --> 01:12:07.220
You hit a woman when she's not seeing, you bastard!

01:12:07.220 --> 01:12:09.490
Here's the spear, Your Highness!

01:12:09.490 --> 01:12:25.310
We must return, Shinji. I have a bad feeling about this.

01:12:25.310 --> 01:12:29.510
You can't talk to them seriously! We're going to get them!

01:12:30.090 --> 01:12:33.330
You don't understand. They are not the spears we need.

01:12:33.330 --> 01:12:44.630
They are not? How? We needed them! They are...

01:12:44.630 --> 01:12:51.310
The control system!

01:12:51.310 --> 01:13:00.000
I'm doing it for you, Kaoru! For you and for everyone I know!

01:13:04.510 --> 01:13:07.770
If I can restore the world, even Misato will do it!

01:13:07.810 --> 01:13:09.710
Oh, no!

01:13:11.910 --> 01:13:21.960
If you said it, here's my ass under the blanket.

01:13:22.550 --> 01:13:24.290
That's not Campo Ate.

01:13:24.590 --> 01:13:27.460
His unity can't be.

01:13:34.640 --> 01:13:41.620
- -Fuck, Shinji!

01:14:06.110 --> 01:14:08.520
Fuyutsuki, let's begin.

01:14:08.520 --> 01:14:17.100
Eva Mark 6?

01:14:17.100 --> 01:14:19.010
Wait, Blue Boss?

01:14:19.010 --> 01:14:21.710
What's going on?

01:14:21.710 --> 01:14:24.760
Oh no!

01:14:24.760 --> 01:14:27.140
The 12th Angel shows signs of life!

01:14:42.350 --> 01:14:43.440
That was my order.

01:15:04.060 --> 01:15:09.220
You are wasting ammo shooting like that, all that is nuclear

01:15:09.220 --> 01:15:12.310
It does not matter, we can not even make a scratch

01:15:12.310 --> 01:15:18.900
Besides, even if we beat the final angel, who knows what would come next?

01:15:18.900 --> 01:15:21.480
That would have to see it

01:15:21.480 --> 01:15:25.920
She is...

01:15:30.120 --> 01:15:31.120
That is...

01:15:31.120 --> 01:15:32.160
It's me.

01:15:32.160 --> 01:15:35.190
What am I?

01:15:35.190 --> 01:15:36.560
I can't.

01:15:38.870 --> 01:15:48.910
To think that I could have been so easily cheated.

01:15:48.910 --> 01:15:51.910
Me, the first angel defeated by the thirteenth.

01:15:51.910 --> 01:15:54.920
What are you talking about?

01:15:54.920 --> 01:16:00.000
It means that the end and the beginning are one and the same.

01:16:00.000 --> 01:16:06.040
the same, all devised by the king of Lilith, all planned by your father.

01:16:06.040 --> 01:16:11.850
The DSS gargantua detected a blue pattern, but the thirteenth is not supposed to exist.

01:16:11.850 --> 01:16:16.890
This is what Gendo has been looking for so long.

01:16:16.890 --> 01:16:21.270
The time has come to review the agreement of the dead sea rolls.

01:16:21.270 --> 01:16:30.000
Now we say goodbye. Although they could have transformed the forms of their souls, they are still

01:16:30.030 --> 01:16:35.860
forms of life endowed with the fruit of knowledge. They can be able to live

01:16:35.860 --> 01:16:41.910
for eternity, but like us, they cannot avoid death when it comes to them.

01:16:41.910 --> 01:16:48.450
They helped the evolution of the overwhelmed with death, granting us the

01:16:48.450 --> 01:16:54.930
complexity of civilization. In the name of humanity, I am very

01:16:54.930 --> 01:17:00.000
grateful. I grant you your death, we honor your souls

01:17:00.000 --> 01:17:03.860
returning them to their legitimate place.

01:17:03.860 --> 01:17:07.770
Be sure that the Human Instrumentalization Project

01:17:07.770 --> 01:17:10.340
and the decision you have sought so much

01:17:10.340 --> 01:17:12.170
will be carried out for you.

01:17:12.170 --> 01:17:14.630
Please rest in peace.

01:17:14.630 --> 01:17:17.800
Our desire for humanity has already occurred.

01:17:17.800 --> 01:17:19.860
And you can see, it's good.

01:17:19.860 --> 01:17:21.640
Everything is very good.

01:17:21.640 --> 01:17:24.380
May the Human Instrumentalization take place,

01:17:24.380 --> 01:17:27.590
as well as the peaceful purification of souls.

01:18:00.380 --> 01:18:02.630
He reached the pseudo-DMS phase.

01:18:02.630 --> 01:18:05.240
That thing is strange.

01:18:05.240 --> 01:18:09.830
He must be an outcast.

01:19:04.730 --> 01:19:08.530
This is my fault, because I took out the spears?

01:19:08.530 --> 01:19:24.190
This is the fourth impact. You are witnessing the entrance rites.

01:20:13.980 --> 01:20:21.280
Increase the central torque!

01:20:21.280 --> 01:20:26.240
The rudder doesn't respond! We're going downhill!

01:20:39.440 --> 01:20:42.300
He wants Unit 1. It means returning the ship.

01:20:42.300 --> 01:20:45.200
Adam's ship was the original love of Wunder.

01:20:45.200 --> 01:20:53.680
Why isn't the bond recovered?

01:21:00.160 --> 01:21:03.650
The situation is right at the edge of a tragedy.

01:21:03.650 --> 01:21:07.230
Cover the mucus of the EVA, I'll do what I can to help Wunder.

01:21:07.230 --> 01:21:08.200
Understood.

01:21:08.200 --> 01:21:09.110
We can't shake the ship!

01:21:09.110 --> 01:21:10.110
The data has been identified and has been filtered manually.

01:21:10.110 --> 01:21:11.110
The main control system.

01:21:11.110 --> 01:21:12.110
The main control system has been deleted.

01:21:12.110 --> 01:21:13.110
The ship's control system has been deleted.

01:21:13.110 --> 01:21:14.160
The ship's control system has been deleted.

01:21:14.160 --> 01:21:15.840
The ship's control system has been deleted.

01:22:18.270 --> 01:22:20.270
It's the unit 2! It's attacking a ship!

01:22:20.270 --> 01:22:22.630
I'll count on you, Asuka.

01:22:41.040 --> 01:22:42.080
What would Ayanami do?

01:22:42.080 --> 01:22:43.520
What would she do now?

01:22:43.520 --> 01:22:44.510
What would she do?

01:22:44.510 --> 01:22:45.510
I have no idea!

01:22:45.510 --> 01:22:46.390
The question is:

01:23:02.810 --> 01:23:08.770
There's no time for that, damn it!

01:23:30.120 --> 01:23:32.760
Captain, we can't do it if the engine doesn't work.

01:23:33.420 --> 01:23:34.260
Shinji!

01:24:01.120 --> 01:24:04.020
I... I...

01:24:05.000 --> 01:24:09.260
It's not your fault, Shinji.

01:24:09.260 --> 01:24:11.910
It happened because I became the 13th Angel.

01:24:11.910 --> 01:24:14.240
I'm the detonator, not you.

01:24:14.240 --> 01:24:16.450
It's gonna be...

01:24:31.020 --> 01:24:36.600
Even after a soul has left, her desires and curses still cling to this world.

01:24:36.600 --> 01:24:41.620
Her will will be to cling to the information of the world and transform it.

01:24:41.620 --> 01:24:46.480
Over time we will write the same nature of what we are.

01:24:46.480 --> 01:24:53.430
I'm sorry, this is not the happiness you wanted and deserved.

01:24:53.430 --> 01:24:55.830
I'm going to close the doors of the G.O.F.

01:24:55.830 --> 01:24:59.250
I don't want you to keep worrying Shinji.

01:25:02.720 --> 01:25:03.720
What are you telling me?

01:25:03.720 --> 01:25:04.570
I don't understand!

01:25:04.570 --> 01:25:24.430
Keep looking, I know you'll find peace in the place where you belong.

01:25:24.430 --> 01:25:26.500
Let the bonds that bind us be your guide.

01:25:31.280 --> 01:25:36.950
Try not to be so sad, we'll see each other again, Shinji.

01:26:00.350 --> 01:26:02.500
Chorro must be Selly's police!

01:27:26.910 --> 01:27:30.000
What a horrible disaster.

01:27:30.000 --> 01:27:36.030
the same plans as sally is not true we eliminate the son of celi and

01:27:36.030 --> 01:27:40.100
we successfully directed unit 13 to his awakening even the colonel

01:27:40.100 --> 01:27:47.860
katsuragi acted as expected this will be fine for now

01:27:55.350 --> 01:28:00.000
we managed to avoid a fourth impact I have no idea why

01:28:00.030 --> 01:28:05.280
Misato, for now let's say this was a victory.

01:28:55.340 --> 01:29:00.000
- You're an idiot, you didn't even come to rescue me, thank you very much.

01:29:00.000 --> 01:29:04.190
- Thank you.

01:29:04.190 --> 01:29:06.660
- All you do is think about yourself.

01:29:06.660 --> 01:29:10.560
You think being quiet is the answer.

01:29:33.360 --> 01:29:35.920
You're still acting like a baby.

01:29:35.920 --> 01:29:41.720
Even after all these years, you're still the same annoying idiot.

01:29:41.720 --> 01:29:43.540
Please, put this on.

01:29:43.540 --> 01:29:45.150
It can't be!

01:29:45.150 --> 01:29:48.080
You can't even stand on your damn feet!

01:29:48.080 --> 01:29:52.750
Huh?

01:29:52.750 --> 01:29:54.590
You were that pilot, right?

01:29:54.590 --> 01:29:57.420
From the first lot of Ayanami type.

01:30:05.050 --> 01:30:08.930
The density of containment field is very strong for us to be rescued here.

01:30:08.930 --> 01:30:12.610
We have to go to some place where Lilith can get close.

01:30:16.600 --> 01:30:17.600
Come here!

01:30:46.160 --> 01:30:47.090
will continue.

01:35:05.340 --> 01:35:10.800
At the lack of will to live, Shinji and Kari wander off, but the place they arrive at

01:35:10.800 --> 01:35:15.360
teaches them what hope is. The project of instrumentalization finally enters

01:35:15.360 --> 01:35:19.500
into motion. Vile makes an offer for a final confrontation to avoid the final impact.

01:35:19.500 --> 01:35:25.090
Gunder flies in the skies. Eva Unit 8 + 2 scratches the entire red wall of the earth.

01:35:25.090 --> 01:35:30.000
Next time, Shin Evangelion Theater Edition. And as always, I'll keep

01:35:30.160 --> 01:35:32.120
entertaining to the admirers.
